$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh V" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Raining, severe gravitic anomalies" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> A gravitic storm has torn Tawa Mangahela apart. UPDRAFT COLUMNS beside each flag tower hurl you to the sky - step in and ride the surge. The LOW-GRAV DOME over midfield turns every jump into flight, and high above it floats a ZERO-G pocket where the fearless can hang weightless and snipe. Two JETSTREAM lanes flank the field - the east wind carries you toward <vServer::teamName1>'s base, the west wind toward <vServer::teamName0>'s. Ride the storm, grab the enemy flag, and bring it home. Eight captures wins!";
